<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>武道 · 青河渡口</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/tools/sandbox-s0/workbench.css"></head>
<body><main id="app"><header class="masthead"><div class="brand"><span class="seal">武</span><div><h1>武道</h1><p>大曜江湖 · 青河渡口</p></div></div><div class="chapter">水路初逢<span>一场点到为止的切磋</span></div><div class="weather"><button data-action="weather" data-value="day" aria-pressed="true">晴昼</button><button data-action="weather" data-value="night" aria-pressed="false">灯夜</button><button data-action="weather" data-value="rain" aria-pressed="false">烟雨</button></div></header>
<section class="play-layout"><div class="world-panel"><div class="location"><span>金陵东郊</span><h2>青河渡口</h2><p id="world-status">申时 · 河风微凉</p></div><div id="stage" tabindex="0" role="application" aria-label="渡口场地，点击行走；方向键移动，数字键选择同伴"><div id="scene"></div><canvas id="overlay" aria-hidden="true"></canvas><div id="targets"></div></div><div class="scene-caption"><span>银杏落处，是行人暂歇的地方。</span><button data-action="grid" aria-pressed="false">显示落脚处</button></div><div id="party" class="party" aria-label="同行之人"></div></div>
<aside class="story"><div class="story-heading"><span class="eyebrow">渡口见闻</span><h2>试一试身手</h2><p>船行护院横棍作揖，邀众人在空地上走上几招。双方说定，以兵器脱手或气力不支为止。</p></div><div id="selection" class="selection"></div><p id="feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite">点选地面可以行走，也可选择同行之人。</p><div id="actions" class="actions"></div><div class="chronicle"><h3>此间经过</h3><ol id="log" aria-live="polite"></ol></div></aside></section>
<footer class="workbench"><details><summary>S0 定标工具 · 规则与画面检查</summary><div class="lab-controls"><label>空间规则<select id="topology"><option value="grid">四向方格 · 首发方案</option><option value="nodes">稀疏节点 · 对照方案</option></select></label><label>渲染路径<select id="backend"><option value="webgl">WebGL2 · 正交对照</option><option value="canvas">Canvas2D · S1 基线</option></select></label><label>检查视口<select id="viewport"><option value="auto">跟随窗口</option><option value="desktop">1280 × 720</option><option value="landscape">844 × 390</option><option value="portrait">390 × 844</option></select></label><button data-action="gray">切换灰盒</button><button data-action="reset">重新定标</button><button data-action="save">保存练武记录</button><button data-action="load">读取练武记录</button><button data-action="benchmark">开始性能采样</button><button data-action="stress">切换压力场景</button><button data-action="replay">运行验收演练</button></div><p>方向键／WASD 行走，1—4 选择同伴，空格交还回合；记录与原版进度完全分离。这里的角色动作与天气用于定标，完整生产动作集在后续制作。</p><pre id="metrics">等待采样。</pre><pre id="replay-result">等待验收演练。</pre><p id="error-report" role="alert"></p></details></footer></main><div id="orientation">请将画卷横置，再看这一段江湖。</div><div id="fatal" hidden><h2>画卷尚未展开</h2><p id="fatal-message"></p><button onclick="location.reload()">重新展开</button></div>
<script type="module" src="/tools/sandbox-s0/app.mjs"></script></body></html>
